OL,3,AMan and boy arrested after allegedly
OL,4,Aattacking One Nation volunteer with
OL,5,Abaseball bat in Australia
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo people have been arrested after a
OL,8,Fvolunteer for Australia's right-wing
OL,9,Fpopulist party One Nation was allegedly
OL,10,Fassaulted with a baseball bat.
OL,12,FA man, 37, and a boy, 14, were arrested
OL,13,Fon Sunday night after an incident
OL,14,Foutside the volunteer's home in
OL,15,FTorquay, about 100km (62 miles)
OL,16,Fsouth-west of Melbourne.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
