OL,3,AMan and boy arrested after allegedly
OL,4,Aattacking One Nation volunteer with
OL,5,Abaseball bat in Australia
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe man was charged with assault
OL,8,Foffences and remanded in custody while
OL,9,Fthe boy was issued with a caution. The
OL,10,Fvolunteer was hospitalised with
OL,11,Fnon-life threatening injuries, police
OL,12,Fsaid. He remains in a stable condition.
OL,14,FOne Nation's Victorian leader Warren
OL,15,FPickering claimed the attack happened
OL,16,Fafter the pair "interfered with"
OL,17,Felection signs on the volunteer's
OL,18,Fproperty.
